<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all four credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all four credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed all four of its credit auctions in the secondary market Monday.</p>
<p>The credits were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM	MAX    MIN    AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.328 bln pesos   14 days   25.52  25.35  25.43</p>
<p>1.328 bln pesos   11 days   25.47  25.43  25.44</p>
<p>1.329 bln pesos    9 days   25.50  25.31  25.42</p>
<p>1.000 bln pesos    1 day    24.82  24.72  24.75</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 7289500</p>
</text>
